The trend of these product areas is moving towards closed-loop therapeutic systems. Sense integrates multimodal information through omics, imaging, connectomics, biosignal, and rehabilitation information into time-aligned stores. Infer applies combinations of temporal, spatial, causal, vascular, and immune modeling to identify targetable levers, contributing the best time to the models to prepare [
